     2	Re-judging is the day's step (D63, 2026-10-24: once a day, over every view whose reading changed that day), run by
     3	the replay after the day's items and before pull mode; see judge_day. Each step appends its processing row in the
     4	same commit as its writes; a resume continues at the step the processing record names (after an ok step, or the
     5	failed step itself) and never repeats a completed step."""
